# .claude/settings.json IS committed -- it is the shared, machine-independent
# half: the permission allowlist and this machine's directory grants.
# Only the local override is private. Ignoring the whole .claude directory, as
# this line used to, made that impossible.
# The trailing * also covers the .bak that init_machine.py keeps of the
# first version it ever replaced.
.claude/settings.local.json*

